    '@type': 'BlogPosting',
    headline: 'Career switch tips for IT professionals India: check the bond, the counter-offer, and the interview gap first',
    description:
      'Career switch tips for IT professionals India: audit your notice period and bond clause, handle a counter-offer without regret, prep for lateral interviews, and pick the right kind of switch for your situation.',
    datePublished: publishedDateISO,
    dateModified: publishedDateISO,
    mainEntityOfPage: canonical,
    inLanguage: 'en-IN',
    author: {
      '@type': 'Person',
